      <div class=\"item\">\n                <a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/events\/booming-digital-marketing-career-in-ai-era?utm_source=WsBlog&#038;utm_medium=blog_master_class_slider&#038;utm_campaign=SEO\" target=\"_blank\">\n                    <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/deen3evddmddt.cloudfront.net\/uploads\/master-class-media\/1a_-_2026-08-07T104930_382_1786105407836_186872.webp\" alt=\"Booming Digital Marketing Career in AI Era\" \/>\n                <\/a>\n            <\/div>\n            <div class=\"item\">\n                <a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/events\/cybersecurity-professional-career-roadmap-2026-2?utm_source=WsBlog&#038;utm_medium=blog_master_class_slider&#038;utm_campaign=SEO\" target=\"_blank\">\n                    <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/deen3evddmddt.cloudfront.net\/uploads\/master-class-media\/1a_-_2026-08-05T122121_005_1786351858212_930412.webp\" alt=\"Cybersecurity Professional Career Roadmap 2026\" \/>\n                <\/a>\n            <\/div>\n            <\/div>\n        <\/div>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>11. Include Optional Sections<\/strong><\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p>Including sections on Hobbies and Interests and Volunteer work in your resume can significantly enhance its appeal and personalize your professional image. This strategy can be particularly beneficial when figuring out how to make a resume attractive.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Showcasing your hobbies reveals more of your personality, making you a more relatable and holistic candidate. Similarly, detailing your volunteer work highlights your community engagement and demonstrates your commitment to specific values and skills outside of a formal work environment.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>These sections can align with a company&#8217;s culture or the specifics of a job role, suggesting that you&#8217;d be a great cultural fit. This alignment can make your application stand out, helping you connect more effectively with potential employers who value a well-rounded candidate.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>12. Avoid Rejection By The ATS<\/strong><\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p>In today&#8217;s job market, many companies use Applicant Tracking Systems (ATS) to screen resumes before they reach human eyes. To ensure an ATS accepts your resume, using a straightforward format and including industry-relevant keywords is critical. This means avoiding overly complex layouts or graphics, which can confuse the ATS software.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Instead, opt for a clean, straightforward design emphasizing text over visual elements. Additionally, tailor your resume by incorporating keywords frequently used in the job description. These keywords often pertain to specific skills, qualifications, or job titles.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>By aligning your resume&#8217;s content with these terms, you significantly boost the likelihood that your job resume will pass through the ATS successfully and catch the attention of hiring managers, enhancing your chances of securing an interview.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>13. Don&#8217;t Forget To Include Your Portfolio Link<\/strong><\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p>Including a link to your online portfolio in your resume is a strategic move that can significantly enhance your job application. A portfolio provides concrete examples of your work, showcasing your skills, creativity, and professionalism\u2014elements that a traditional resume might not fully capture.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Whether in a creative field like graphic design, writing, or software development, a well-maintained portfolio offers potential employers a deeper insight into your capabilities and accomplishments. It allows them to visualize the quality and scope of your work, assess your fit for their needs, and understand the value you can bring to their organization.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>You demonstrate your technical skills, initiative, and dedication to your profession by embedding a link to your portfolio. This can be incredibly persuasive in making a resume good, making you stand out from other candidates who may only provide a conventional resume.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>14. Proofread the Final Product<\/strong><\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p>Proofreading your resume is a critical step in the job application process. Before you submit your resume, it&#8217;s crucial to review it several times to ensure it&#8217;s completely free of typos and grammatical errors. Even a tiny mistake can undermine your professionalism and reduce your chances of making a good impression.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>When you ask yourself, how can I make a resume for a job effectively? Remember that attention to detail can set you apart from other candidates. Take the time to read through your resume carefully, ideally aloud, to catch errors you might overlook when reading silently.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Use grammar-checking tools or ask a trusted friend or mentor to review your resume. This meticulous final check ensures your resume is polished and reflects high professionalism, significantly boosting your likelihood of securing an interview.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/digital-marketing-course?utm_source=WsBlog&amp;utm_medium=Content_Banner&amp;utm_campaign=SEO&amp;utm_page=\/how-to-making-resume\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1546\" height=\"380\" src=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/best-digital-marketing-course.webp\" alt=\"Best Digital Marketing Course\" class=\"wp-image-14518\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/best-digital-marketing-course.webp 1546w, https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/best-digital-marketing-course-300x74.webp 300w, https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/best-digital-marketing-course-1024x252.webp 1024w, https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/best-digital-marketing-course-768x189.webp 768w, https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/best-digital-marketing-course-1536x378.webp 1536w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1546px) 100vw, 1546px\" \/><\/a><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>FAQs on How to Make a Resume in 2026<\/strong><\/h2>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"schema-faq wp-block-yoast-faq-block\"><div class=\"schema-faq-section\" id=\"faq-question-1721123274910\"><strong class=\"schema-faq-question\">1. <strong>What is the best format for writing a resume in 2026?<\/strong><\/strong> <p class=\"schema-faq-answer\">The best format for writing a resume depends on your career stage and goals. For those with steady career progression, a chronological format is ideal. If you have gaps in employment or are changing fields, a functional format may work better. The combination format, which highlights both skills and experience, is beneficial for those who want to showcase a balance of both.<\/p> <\/div> <div class=\"schema-faq-section\" id=\"faq-question-1721123290939\"><strong class=\"schema-faq-question\">2. <strong>How can I make a resume stand out to employers?<\/strong><\/strong> <p class=\"schema-faq-answer\">To make your resume attractive and stand out, focus on tailoring it with keywords from the job description, showcasing quantifiable achievements, and ensuring a clean, professional layout. A unique resume format that aligns with your industry can also grab attention.<\/p> <\/div> <div class=\"schema-faq-section\" id=\"faq-question-1721123364415\"><strong class=\"schema-faq-question\">3. <strong>How to write a resume for students with little work experience?<\/strong><\/strong> <p class=\"schema-faq-answer\">When writing a student resume, emphasize educational achievements, relevant coursework, volunteer work, and extracurricular activities. Including a skills section highlighting hard and soft skills pertinent to the job can also significantly enhance a student&#8217;s resume.<\/p> <\/div> <div class=\"schema-faq-section\" id=\"faq-question-1721123392371\"><strong class=\"schema-faq-question\">4. <strong>How do I write my resume in an ATS-friendly way?<\/strong><\/strong> <p class=\"schema-faq-answer\">To ensure your job resume-making is ATS-friendly, use a simple format without complex graphics or unusual fonts, include keywords from the job description, and structure your sections. This makes your resume for a job more accessible for the ATS to read and more likely to be forwarded to a human recruiter.<\/p> <\/div> <div class=\"schema-faq-section\" id=\"faq-question-1721123408459\"><strong class=\"schema-faq-question\">5. <strong>What should I do if I need to create or update my resume on my phone?<\/strong><\/strong> <p class=\"schema-faq-answer\">Many apps and online platforms offer mobile-friendly resume templates if you&#8217;re figuring out how to make a resume on the phone. Look for services that allow you to customize and save various resume versions, enabling you to apply for jobs directly from your device.<\/p> <\/div> <\/div>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Final Thoughts<\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>In today&#8217;s competitive job market, knowing how to make a great resume is more crucial than ever. Whether updating your resume or crafting your first job application, remember that a well-constructed resume is your ticket to catching an employer&#8217;s eye and opening doors to new career opportunities. By following the above guidelines, you&#8217;ll be well on your way to creating a good resume that positions you as the ideal candidate for your dream job.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Read more blogs:<\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/career-options-after-bca\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Career Options After BCA in [Courses, Jobs Opportunities, Salary, etc]<\/a><\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><a href=\"https:\/\